    "paragraph": "DREAM introduces a defensive risk-aware maneuver planning framework for autonomous vehicles in heterogeneous traffic using partial differential equations and model predictive control with control barrier functions. Monthly Rhythms of Intercity Travel analyzes the 2023 seasonal dynamics and temporal fluctuations of population mobility across Chinese cities using AMap location-based migration data. LEON presents a self-supervised representation learning framework that generates urban location embeddings from OpenStreetMap amenity distributions mapped over H3 hexagonal grids using Graph Masked Autoencoders.",
